description_en:
Yet another incredible South American version of the modified eFootball PES 2026 game is available on our app! In this PES 26 release, you’ll find updated South American squads and clubs. Although the patch doesn't focus on European clubs, the game boasts high-quality textures, including realistic player skins and faces. It features updated kits and uniforms with high-quality textures, as well as recently updated rosters and championships.

After many requests for an updated 2026 soccer game focused on South American and Spanish teams, we decided to launch this amazing modified title. It highlights the Argentine and Brazilian leagues, along with leagues from across South America—featuring top clubs from Uruguay, Colombia, Ecuador, Chile, and more!

New systems, modern menus, and enhanced game modes deliver a genuine evolution for those who live and breathe soccer, both on and off the pitch.

Please note that this game is a South American-focused modification—featuring updated teams and squads—built upon PES 2014, the final version released for the PlayStation Portable! CREDITS:

